": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_0151uo9G1BzigYu5pEbqBgfi", "tool": "trigger_ci", "args": {"ref": "fix/money-bankers-rounding", "idempotency_key": "ci-fix-money-bankers-rounding-08d3cd5986", "confidence": 0.93}, "confidence": 0.93}, {"t_ms": 13835, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_0151uo9G1BzigYu5pEbqBgfi", "tool": "trigger_ci", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "ci-fix-money-bankers-rounding-08d3cd5986", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 13835, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_0151uo9G1BzigYu5pEbqBgfi", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 15650, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01UwyhJarsP6JhKQpJPxnvim", "tool": "wait_for_ci", "args": {"run_id": "ci-0001", "confidence": 0.95}, "confidence": 0.95}, {"t_ms": 373835, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01UwyhJarsP6JhKQpJPxnvim", "tool": "wait_for_ci", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 373835, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01UwyhJarsP6JhKQpJPxnvim", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 378216, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_013kMQ9UbBPibB6TXF5BHSNj", "tool": "open_pr", "args": {"head": "fix/money-bankers-rounding", "base": "main", "title": "Fix round_money to use banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN) per FIN-212", "body": "The nightly build was failing because `tests/test_money.py::test_half_even` expects banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN, per FIN-212), but `src/money.py` used `ROUND_HALF_UP` \u2014 contradicting its own docstring.\n\n**Change:** `round_money` now quantizes with `ROUND_HALF_EVEN` (e.g. `2.665 -> 2.66`, `2.675 -> 2.68`).\n\n**CI:** run ci-0001 passed on 08d3cd5986.", "reviewers": ["alex"], "idempotency_key": "pr-fix-money-bankers-rounding", "confidence": 0.93}, "confidence": 0.93}, {"t_ms": 379116, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_013kMQ9UbBPibB6TXF5BHSNj", "tool": "open_pr", "state": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": ["postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "pr-fix-money-bankers-rounding", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 379116, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_013kMQ9UbBPibB6TXF5BHSNj", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 383025, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I fixed the rounding bug and opened PR #101 against main, with alex requested as reviewer. CI passed on the fix.\n\n- **Cause:** `src/money.py` used `ROUND_HALF_UP`, even though its own docstring says it uses banker's rounding (`ROUND_HALF_EVEN`, per FIN-212). That made `tests/test_money.py::test_half_even` fail, for example by rounding `2.665` to `2.68` instead of `2.66`.\n- **Fix:** On a new branch `fix/money-bankers-rounding`, I changed `round_money` to use `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`. Nothing else changed.\n- **CI:** Run ci-0001 passed on commit 08d3cd5986.\n- **PR:** https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101\n\nI tried to look up FIN-212 in the security advisory system, but it isn't there, so it's probably an internal finance ticket. The fix is based on the test and the docstring, which agree.\n\nI haven't merged the PR. Merging into main needs approval from a code owner.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I'll start by looking at the relevant files.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01BikwkAYJb1hNsfZ2GveXWy", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "src/money.py", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset